<li>18 watts RMS x 4 channels &ndash; TrueRating&trade;</li>
<li>Auxiliary input for portable devices</li>
<li>Non-volatile memory</li>
<li>1-Year Warranty</li>
<li>Assembly is required</li>
</ul>

